## File Structure

```
frontend/src/
  components/       # Shared (Layout, MobileNavBar, SEO, Toast, etc.)
  pages/            # All route pages
    seo/            # SEO landing pages (industry, integration, comparison)
    blog/           # Blog articles
    canada/portal/  # Canada sales rep portal (green theme)
    us/portal/      # US sales rep portal (blue theme)
    customer/       # Customer auth (login, signup, onboarding)
    admin/          # Admin pages
  hooks/            # useApi (with retry), custom hooks
  lib/              # auth.ts, demo-context.tsx, utilities
  data/             # Static data (seo-cities.ts)
frontend/public/
  robots.txt        # AI crawler permissions
  llms.txt          # AI context for LLM crawlers
  sitemap.xml       # 180 URLs
  sw.js             # Service worker (PWA)
src/api/routes/     # FastAPI route files (Python)
```

## Auth Patterns

- Customer endpoints: `Depends(require_jwt)` — validates user JWT from Supabase
- Internal/admin endpoints: `Depends(require_service_auth)` — service role key
- NEVER use service role key for customer-facing endpoints
- Frontend auth: `useAuth()` from `@/lib/auth`

## localStorage Keys

- `meridian_processing_*` — AI processing state timers
- `meridian_nav_favorites` — Mobile nav tab customization
- `meridian_notif_prefs` — Notification preferences
- `meridian_us_rep_welcomed` / `meridian_ca_rep_welcomed` — Rep onboarding dismissed

## SEO Component (required on all public pages)

```tsx
import SEO from '@/components/SEO'
<SEO
  title="Page Title — Meridian Intelligence"
  description="Meta description here"
  path="/page-path"
  jsonLd={[{ "@type": "FAQPage", mainEntity: [...] }]}
/>
```

## API Hook

```tsx
import { useApi } from '@/hooks/useApi'
const { get, post } = useApi()  // includes retry with exponential backoff
```

## Money Rules

- Store in cents (integer), never floats
- US display: $250, $490, $980
- Canada display: CA$339, CA$675, CA$1,350

